==== modelWeaponPart ====
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the weapon attachment. Format: "partType modelName attachmentNameSelf attachmentParent"
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ModelWeaponPart = x8Scope x8Scope scope scope,
</syntaxhighlight>

